MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_001: Here we go! Ooh, it's a big one! Let it run a bit, and...\nGot it!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_002: Hey, Cai! I didn't know you were a fisher. Let's see\nyour catch!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_003: Hi, Esmeralda! Sure, take a look. I got some\nreal whoppers.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_004: I'll see about that. Whoa, good haul! Hmm, this one\nthough...what are you going to do with it?
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_005: Fry it up and eat it, of course. Why? Do you want it?
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_006: Oh, no. No, no, no. That fish, that size? All bones. If I\ncaught that, I'd cast my net in a totally different spot.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_007: Nah, if you roast it slowly, you can eat it, bones and\nall. And you can take a nap while you wait!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_008: Nap? Who has time to nap? In my village, we work\nfrom first light till it's dark out.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_009: Really? I thought that if you fish, you get to rest once\nyou've caught enough for the day.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_010: You're kidding, right? You need to fix the tears in the\nnets, sharpen your spears... The work never ends.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_011: Wow! You worked that hard? I'm impressed!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_012: Don't be. That's just how it is. It's not like I ever\nthought it was a big deal.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_013: We all worked so hard because we had to. If we\ndidn't all pitch in, the village would go belly-up.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_014: Truth is, we came this close, thanks to the headman's\nidiot son and the stunt he pulled.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_015: I'm sorry. I didn't mean to bring up bad memories.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_016: It's OK. What's past is past. I can even look back on\nalmost being sacrificed and laugh.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_017: How can you say that? If it was me, I'd want to\nforget all about it.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_018: How can I say that? Because that's how I\nmet Sweetie!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_019: My life was spared, and I was swept up by fate. Look\nat it that way, and I'm almost too lucky!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_020: Just thinking back to that day... Seeing Sweetie in\naction for the first time... Ahh... Incredible.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_021: {SetColor=Gray}Huh. She really loves Dietrich.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_022: {SetColor=Gray}I wonder what it feels like to fall so deep in love.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_023: Sorry! Got lost for a minute there.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_024: Hehehe... Me too.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_025: Oh? What were you thinking about?
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_026: Oh! Uh... Just that I'd like to try fishing the way you\nused to do it.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_027: Sure! It's not too hard. Next time, we'll cast out our\nnet and see what we get!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_C_028: Aww, why'd I lie like that? Oh well. It'll be fun to\nfish with a net.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_001: OK, you need to twist your hips. And when you've\ngot it just right...cast your net. Get it?
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_002: I'll try it like you showed me. Here we go! Hup!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_003: Not bad, kid! You got it.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_004: Hehehe... It's 'cause I had a good teacher. I just\nlistened to what you said and copied what you did.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_005: Yeah, you do listen, and you learn fast. Teaching you\nis easy!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_006: Then...can I ask you something?
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_007: Well, sure... What's on your mind? Sounds serious.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_008: I, uh...was hoping you could...tell me what it's like to\nfall in love.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_009: I know what it feels like to care for someone or to\nadmire them.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_010: But I think that must be different from the way you\nfeel about Dietrich.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_011: Wow. I did not expect that. That head of yours is\nfull of interesting ideas.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_012: You don't have to be mean. I just thought this was\nsomething you know a lot about.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_013: Maybe that was a little mean. Sorry.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_014: It's just...it's not the kind of thing you can explain.\nAnd there's not one answer—everyone's different.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_015: Maybe. But I still want to hear what you have to say\non the subject.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_016: I need to know what to do if I find out that someone\nhas feelings for me. I need a strategy, right?
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_017: No, I don't think so. When it actually happens, you'll \nfigure it out then and there.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_018: Because that person will like you for who you are. So\nthe best thing to do is just be you.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_019: Are you sure about that?
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_020: You know, you're not that different from Sweetie.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_021: What? Dietrich's...like me?
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_022: Well, in one way. When it comes to other people's\nfeelings, neither of you knows how to respond.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_023: No matter how many times I tell him how I feel... He\njust says, "I see."
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_024: But that's just how he is. And I know that, so it\ndoesn't bother me. I still love him.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_025: So don't try and plan this one out. Nobody wants to\nhear some answer you cooked up years ago.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_026: Hmm... I guess I get it now. Thanks!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_B_027: {SetColor=Gray}Her eyes are so pretty.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_001: Hyah! Cai! Over there! It went that way!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_002: Yep! I'm on it! Luuure it in, and... Ngaah!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_003: This thing's back is slippery. So we roll it over and\nstart dressing it from its belly, right?
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_004: Right. But be careful with the knife. You don't want\nto puncture the innards—they're really tasty.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_005: Yep! I've got it. The incision's done. I just need to\nskin it.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_006: Hey, you do have the hang of this. Now all that's left\nis to get it ready.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_007: Ahhh, just about done. That was a big one, wasn't\nit? Took a while.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_008: Cai, I need a little help to finish up. Can you hold the\nfin for me? Cai? You with me here?
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_009: Oh! Uh... Fin? OK, I've got it.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_010: {SetColor=Gray}Her eyes are so cute when she's serious. I could stare\ninto them forever.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_011: Oh! I get it now!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_012: Get it? Get what? What's up?
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_013: Esmeralda, I think I know what it's like to fall\nin love!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_014: Oh! Wow. OK, so...you have a crush on someone?\nWho is it? Do I know them? Spill!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_015: H-hey! Gimme some breathing room!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_016: Heehee. Sorry! It's true though, isn't it? You're in\nLOVE! Come on, who is it?
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_017: It's, uh...a little hard to talk about it right now.\nI'm kinda embarrassed.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_018: Oh? You were such a good kid too! But here you are\nkeeping secrets. Ah, they grow up so fast!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_019: To celebrate your first love, I'll give you the tastiest\npart of the innards. Usually I save that for Sweetie.
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_020: Thanks! I won't let it go to waste!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_021: You better not! And if you ever want to talk about\nthat crush, you come to me! OK? Well, see you later!
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_022: {SetColor=Gray}Yeah, I'll be sure to tell you...when I'm ready.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Kai_Esm_A_023: {SetColor=Gray}Someday. For sure.{SetColor=Default}